Acknowledgement

linux_disk_prune is inspired by disktree by Tobi Lütke
(https://github.com/tobi/disktree, MIT License): the treemap design (colour by
kind of data, hatched reclaimable space, a reserved selection colour), the
mark -> review -> remove flow, and disk-usage measuring (st_blocks x 512,
hard links counted once) follow its approach. No disktree source code is
included; this is an independent implementation (egui/wgpu desktop app
and ratatui terminal UI).
